VALUES ('33c941fae57ba8d1e23bc1dff9ce3e2c', '1759262838.442871', 'D05HB64NMQU', 'message', 'EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID', 'forgot one thing: leave the analytics and tutorial tickets off the list (30, 49, 50, 161, 262 and 275), they don''t change how hard a level plays. and in your reply put the keys of the not shipped ones and the editor only ones so i know who to chase. and when you comment on the editor only and not shipped ones, put the two builds in the comment (ios 0.3.49 and android 0.3.133) so people can see what you checked against', '6f77386571537f0bd88c959bdc216f94', '1759261706.530914', 0, 0, NULL, false, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', '2025-09-30T20:07:18.442871Z', '{}');
